a function in `shared(...)` or a lock cannot capture the `weak` variable `inShared`
a function in `shared(...)` or a lock cannot capture the `weak` variable `locked`
a function returned from `with` cannot capture the `weak` variable `v`
a function stored into the locked value cannot capture the `weak` variable `v`
a function that uses the `weak` variable `sent` cannot be passed to another task
a function that uses the `weak` variable `v` cannot be passed to another task
an async closure cannot capture the `weak` variable `w`
the function passed to `with` cannot use the `weak` variable `v`
the function passed to `with` cannot use the `weak` variable `w`
